#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "تثبيت واجهة C البرمجية لأحدث إصدار من Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API"
msgstr "تثبيت واجهة C البرمجية"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API {#install-the-c-api}"
msgstr "تثبيت واجهة C البرمجية {#install-the-c-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "المتطلبات المسبقة {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before getting started, you must ensure that you have installed the [Rust toolchain](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) as well as the [clang compiler](https://clang.llvm.org/).\n"
msgstr "قبل البدء، يجب أن تتأكد من تثبيت [سلسلة أدوات Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) وكذلك [مترجم clang](https://clang.llvm.org/).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "الآن، انسخ مستودع `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, you must also compile the Qiskit C API. You can do this in any location, but to get started quickly, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "بعد ذلك، يجب أيضًا أن تُصرِّف واجهة Qiskit C البرمجية. يمكنك فعل ذلك في أي مكان، لكن للبدء بسرعة اتبع هذه الخطوات:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"تلميح\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  On **Windows** only, you need to copy additional library files:\n"
msgstr "  على **Windows** فقط، تحتاج إلى نسخ ملفات مكتبات إضافية:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"<TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"<TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</TabItem>\n"
"  </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can follow the steps in the next section to compile the `qiskit-fermions` C API.\n"
msgstr "الآن يمكنك اتباع الخطوات في القسم التالي لتصريف واجهة `qiskit-fermions` C البرمجية.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compile from source {#compile-from-source}"
msgstr "التصريف من المصدر {#compile-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To get started, configure your shell environment with the locations of your compiled Qiskit C API library and include directory.\n"
msgstr "للبدء، اضبط بيئة الصدفة لديك بمواقع مكتبة Qiskit C API المُصرَّفة ودليل ملفات الترويسة (include).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Important\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  The C API links against the Qiskit **C** library, so `QISKIT_LIB` and `QISKIT_INCLUDE` must resolve to it. If unset, the build attempts to infer them from any installed `qiskit` Python package which bundles its C artifacts (`qiskit.capi.get_lib()`/`get_include()`); set them explicitly, as below, to build against a separately compiled Qiskit C API such as the `build/qiskit` clone above.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"مهم\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  ترتبط واجهة C البرمجية بمكتبة Qiskit **C**، لذا يجب أن يشير `QISKIT_LIB` و`QISKIT_INCLUDE` إليها. وإن لم يُضبطا، تحاول عملية البناء استنتاجهما من أي حزمة `qiskit` لـ Python مثبّتة تضم ملفاتها الخاصة بـ C (`qiskit.capi.get_lib()`/`get_include()`)؛ اضبطهما صراحةً، كما في الأسفل، للبناء مقابل Qiskit C API مُصرَّفة بشكل منفصل مثل نسخة `build/qiskit` أعلاه.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Hint\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  This code uses the `build/qiskit` path from the code at the top of this page. Adjust the paths according to your setup.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"تلميح\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  تستخدم هذه الشيفرة المسار `build/qiskit` من الشيفرة في أعلى هذه الصفحة. عدّل المسارات بما يناسب إعدادك.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"unix\" label=\"UNIX\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"unix\" label=\"UNIX\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    export QISKIT_LIB=$(find $(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/lib -name \"libqiskit.*\")\n"
"    export QISKIT_INCLUDE=$(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/include\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    export QISKIT_LIB=$(find $(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/lib -name \"qiskit_cext.dll.lib\")\n"
"    export QISKIT_INCLUDE=$(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/include\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, compile the `qiskit-fermions` C API:\n"
msgstr "الآن، صرِّف واجهة `qiskit-fermions` C البرمجية:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to test your installation, you now must also install [CMake](https://cmake.org/). You can then test your compilation by running the C unit tests:\n"
msgstr "إذا أردت اختبار تثبيتك، فعليك الآن أيضًا تثبيت [CMake](https://cmake.org/). ويمكنك بعدها اختبار التصريف بتشغيل اختبارات الوحدات بلغة C:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, verify that you see these relevant files:\n"
msgstr "وأخيرًا، تحقق من ظهور هذه الملفات المهمة:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`dist/c/lib/libqiskit_fermions.so` (The suffix might vary depending on your operating system)\n"
msgstr "`dist/c/lib/libqiskit_fermions.so` (قد يختلف اللاحق بحسب نظام التشغيل لديك)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`dist/c/include/qiskit_fermions.h`\n"
msgstr "`dist/c/include/qiskit_fermions.h`\n"
